---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: valid signature from authorized Legion signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: below minimum
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvest
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> [*]: position.investedCapital += amount, totalCapitalInvested += amount, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: open application - any eligible investor can participate
        INV-002: signature verification required for investment authorization
        INV-003: minimumInvestAmount enforced per transaction
        INV-004: no SAFT required (unlike approved sale)
    end note
